*.egg-info/

# NOTE on code/.vscode/: those files are TRACKED, deliberately. gitignore does not
# apply to already-tracked paths, so listing them here would be misleading. They are
# IDE logs and caches that churn every session, and they SHOULD eventually leave the
# repo -- but the removal has to happen from inside the capsule, with `git rm -r
# --cached code/.vscode` while no code-server session is writing them. Deleting them
# in a commit pushed from elsewhere makes every capsule sync a delete-vs-modify
# conflict, 46 of them, which is exactly what happened.
